OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over #42m Senedd office  
OL,4,Ablock renovation as parliament's budget
OL,5,Apassed                                 
OL,7,FConservative and Reform Members of the 
OL,8,FSenedd (MSs) have raised concerns about
OL,9,Fplans to renovate the parliament's     
OL,10,Foffice block.                          
OL,12,FMSs passed the Welsh Parliament's #109m
OL,13,Fbudget for 2027-28 on Wednesday,       
OL,14,Fdespite opposition from the Tories and 
OL,15,FReform UK, and abstentions from most   
OL,16,FLabour members.                        
OL,18,FConservative MS Andrew RT Davies called
OL,19,Fthe renovation plans, expected to cost 
OL,20,F#42m over three years, a "difficult    
OL,21,Fsell" to voters.                       
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
